{
  "dom_id": "step-e335",
  "name": "Example: Determining Increasing and Decreasing Intervals Given the Graph of a Derivative",
  "problem": "The graph of $y=f'(x),$ the derivative of $f(x),$ is given below. Find all the values of $x$ where the function $y=f(x)$ is decreasing.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14193353/assets/d524aa081eec487a6107a3685f87ec97fe6895f1c3b7a91bc4bb07a637f76f40.png)",
  "worked_solution": "First, we recall the following:\n\n- If $f'(x) = 0$ for all $x \\in (a,b),$ then the slope of $f(x)$ is equal to zero on $(a,b).$\n\n- If $f'(x) > 0$ for all $x \\in (a,b),$ then the slope of $f(x)$ is positive on $(a,b).$\n\n- If $f'(x) <            0$ for all $x \\in (a,b),$ then the slope of $f(x)$ is negative on $(a,b).$\n\nFrom the above graph, we can see that $f'(x)$ is negative on the intervals $(-5,-2),$ $(0,2)$ and $(5,\\infty)\\mathbin{:}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14193353/assets/d51ade5596e25a7ba791a3090689a0eacc52e6253ea894257be7e62c71deafa4.png)\n\nTherefore, $f(x)$ is decreasing when $x\\in (-5,-2) \\cup (0,2) \\cup (5,\\infty).$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e335\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Determining Increasing and Decreasing Intervals Given the Graph of a Derivative</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e335\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            